<title>USA: Aluminum Co of America Q4 net off on charge.</title>
<headline>Aluminum Co of America Q4 net off on charge.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.78		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net			136,100		  150,900</p>
<p> Revs		   3,288,500		3,144,100</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.94		    $4.43</p>
<p> Net		     514,9000		  790,500</p>
<p> Revs		  13,128,400	     12,654,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 174,334		  178,018</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call Q4 consensus estimate was $0.86/shr.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 net included charge of $18.4 million -- $16.8 million, or $0.10/shr, after taxes.</p>
<p>1996 year net includes charge of $198.9 million -- $122.3 million, or $0.70/shr, after taxes.</p>
<p>1996 net includes commodity contract gains of $8 million, or $0.05/shr, in quarter and losses of $57.1 million, or $0.33/shr, in year.</p>
<p>Net includes translation and exchange losses of $4.4 million vs $1.9 million in quarter and $300,000 vs $10.2 million in year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
